From: Marionette AirDrop driver research
Subject: [EXPERIMENTAL] hdd: gated monitor RAW AWDL IPv6 data submission

Compile prototype only; not deployed or validated over the air. The module
parameter is default-off and root-only. Does not implement management-frame
TX, rate/retry hints, firmware ACK handling, or Wi-Fi coexistence. It tests
whether the existing DP exception path can submit an unencrypted AWDL data
frame without repurposing the normal station TX handler.

diff --git a/qcacld-3.0/core/hdd/inc/wlan_hdd_tx_rx.h b/qcacld-3.0/core/hdd/inc/wlan_hdd_tx_rx.h
